#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise 2: Estimate $r_y$ value {#exercise-2-estimate-r-y-value}"
msgstr "Ehersisyo 2: Tantiyahin ang halagang $r_y$ {#exercise-2-estimate-r-y-value}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using the same logical arguments as before, we can rotate the system prior to measurement to learn about the $r_y$.\n"
"Try writing code yourself to estimate the value of $r_y$ using the quantum state tomography. You could start with the previous example, but make different rotations. (For more information about the various gates used, including ```sdg```, refer [to the API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SdgGate).)\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamit ang parehong lohikal na argumento tulad ng dati, maaari nating i-rotate ang sistema bago ang pagsukat para matuto nang ukol sa $r_y$.\n"
"Subukang sumulat ng code para tantiyahin ang halaga ng $r_y$ gamit ang quantum state tomography. Maaari kang magsimula sa nakaraang halimbawa, ngunit gumawa ng iba't ibang rotasyon. (Para sa karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa iba't ibang gate na ginamit, kabilang ang ```sdg```, tingnan ang [API reference.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SdgGate))\n"

